  "notes": "USAGE:\n{変容|へんよう} emphasizes qualitative, often deep or fundamental transformation. It is used for large-scale changes in society, culture, values, or identity — not for simple physical changes. Compared to {変化|へんか} (general change) or {変更|へんこう} (deliberate modification), {変容|へんよう} implies a more profound shift.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {社会|しゃかい}の{変容|へんよう}: transformation of society\n- {文化|ぶんか}の{変容|へんよう}: cultural transformation\n- {価値観|かちかん}の{変容|へんよう}: transformation of values\n- {大|おお}きく{変容|へんよう}する: to undergo a major transformation",
